  "abstract": "{\"business_domain\":[\"巨量千川-随心推全域\"],\"business_line\":[\"巨量千川\"],\"capability_summary\":\"创建随心推全域订单，当前仅支持「商品全域」。需配合【获取Access token】【获取可投全域投放抖音号列表】等接口使用。\",\"id\":\"qianchuan.aweme_uni_promotion_order.create\",\"interface_path\":\"/open_api/v1.0/qianchuan/aweme/uni_promotion/order/create/\",\"method\":\"POST\",\"official_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/markdown/get/?language=CHINESE\\u0026doc_id=1834781332397449\",\"related_docs\":[{\"id\":\"qianchuan.get_access_token\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\",\"reason\":\"需要先获取授权access_token才能创建随心推全域订单\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"title\":\"获取Access token\"},{\"id\":\"qianchuan.get_aweme_list\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/12/docs/1771196800070656\",\"reason\":\"创建随心推全域订单时需要提供抖音号id，可通过此接口获取\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"title\":\"获取可投全域投放抖音号列表\"},{\"id\":\"qianchuan.get_merchant_product_list\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/12/docs/1825216221095947\",\"reason\":\"当营销目标为商品全域且客户是商家类型时，创建随心推全域订单需要提供商品ID，可通过此接口获取\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"title\":\"全域商家可选商品列表\"},{\"id\":\"qianchuan.get_daren_product_list\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/12/docs/1825216033296576\",\"reason\":\"当营销目标为商品全域且客户是达人/机构类型时，创建随心推全域订单需要提供商品ID，可通过此接口获取\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"title\":\"全域达人获取可选商品列表\"}],\"risk_level\":\"medium\",\"schema_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/schema/markdown/get/?doc_id=1834781332397449\",\"title\":\" 创建随心推全域订单\"}",
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-olRJEINT\"> 创建随心推全域订单，当前仅支持「商品全域」</p>\n<div class=\"qz-api-metadata\" data-type=\"apimetadata\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22interfaceId%22%3A%201833989002076292%2C%20%22docLibId%22%3A%201748264006369288%7D\">\n \n</div>\n<h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-S7RDag9a\" id=\"h346b9f0-S7RDag9a\">请求地址</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-OK3gpb1S\"><a href=\"https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/v1.0/qianchuan/aweme/uni_promotion/order/create/\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/v1.0/qianchuan/aweme/uni_promotion/order/create/</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/tools/visual_debug.html?docId=1834781332397449\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">可视化调试</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/12/docs/1777555692984388\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">SDK下载</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/12/docs/1839622960207943\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">MCP调用</a></p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-ZCA7Bj0g\" id=\"h346b9f0-ZCA7Bj0g\">请求方法</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-jq7DqFqL\">POST</p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-19DZspsE\" id=\"h346b9f0-19DZspsE\">Header</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"header\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 250px;\" width=\"250\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">Access-Token</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">授权access_token，可以通过【<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\">获取Access token</a>】接口获取</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">Content-Type</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">请求消息类型<br/>允许值: <code>application/json</code></section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-maHf1C8F\" id=\"h346b9f0-maHf1C8F\">请求参数</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"request\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 250px;\" width=\"250\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">advertiser_id</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\">客户id</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">marketing_goal</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">营销目标，允许值：<br/><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-9qVSRsBa\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-Nx07BSzC\"><code>VIDEO_PROM_GOODS</code> 商品全域</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">aweme_id</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-byZm2fs5\">抖音号id</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-88Npt2xX\">可通过【<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/12/docs/1771196800070656\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: #2f54eb;\">获取可投全域投放抖音号列表</span></a>】接口获取</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">product_id</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag success\">条件必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-FZTdtz4S\">商品ID</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-7YFiyo38\">当marketing_goal=<code>VIDEO_PROM_GOODS</code>时必填</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-3kgHag1G\">如果客户是商家类型，通过「<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/12/docs/1825216221095947\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: #2f54eb;\">全域商家可选商品列表</span></a>」获取；</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-qa11TdH9\">如果客户是达人/机构类型，通过「<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/12/docs/1825216033296576\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: #2f54eb;\">全域达人获取可选商品列表</span></a>」获取</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"arrow\" style=\"left: 4px;\"><svg fill=\"none\" height=\"8\" viewbox=\"0 0 6 8\" width=\"6\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M5.08156 4.63972C5.50823 4.31972 5.50823 3.67972 5.08156 3.35972L1.88156 0.959719C1.35417 0.564177 0.601563 0.940483 0.601563 1.59972L0.601562 6.39972C0.601562 7.05896 1.35417 7.43526 1.88156 7.03972L5.08156 4.63972Z\" fill=\"#969AA0\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg></section><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">delivery_setting</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>object</p></section><section class=\"col description\">投放设置</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">bid_type</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag success\">条件必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-OPTx5mmo\">出价类型，允许值：</p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-o21KHHJd\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-6joKuN4p\">系统智能出价：<code>AUTO_BID</code></li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-kc1sotU6\">手动出价：<code>MANUAL_BID</code></li></ul><p data-id=\"p838747a-wm5Bx0Z9\">当marketing_goal=<code>VIDEO_PROM_GOODS</code>时必填</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">roi_goal</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag success\">条件必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>double</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-VHUI3LIf\">支付ROI，最多支持两位小数，取值范围[0.01 - 10000]</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-VGdCRRJS\">当marketing_goal=<code>VIDEO_PROM_GOODS</code>且bid_type=<code>MANUAL_BID</code>时必填</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">delivery_time</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>double</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-hpdJVYgd\">预期投放时长，单位小时，允许值：</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-v41dVK7I\"><code>2</code>、<code>6</code>、<code>12</code>、<code>24</code>、<code>48</code>、<code>72</code>、<code>96</code>、<code>120</code>、<code>144</code>、<code>168</code></p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">amount</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-irVZQVGx\">投放金额，单位元，取值范围[100-5000000]</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-84zo4zr8\">数值需为10的倍数</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">qcpx_mode</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">是否开启智能优惠券，允许值：<br/><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-C1QvXBc8\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-INM5KGcP\"><code>QCPX_MODE_OFF</code> 关闭</li><li data-id=\"ld